<title>USA: Ben &amp; Jerry's Homemade Inc Q3 net slips.</title>
<headline>Ben &amp; Jerry's Homemade Inc Q3 net slips.</headline>
<dateline>WATERBURY, Vt. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>						 Thirteen weeks ended</p>
<p>					 Sep 28, 1996	Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $46,143	     $45,405</p>
<p> Net income				   1,820		 2,525</p>
<p>Weighted average common and</p>
<p>common equivalent # of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding				 7,221		 7,177</p>
<p> Net income per common share	     0.25		  0.35</p>
<p>						 Thirty-nine weeks ended</p>
<p>					 Sep 28, 1996	Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				 $132,075	    $122,545</p>
<p> Net income				   5,127		 5,089</p>
<p>Weighted average common and</p>
<p>common equivalent # of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding				 7,217		 7,157</p>
<p> Net income per common share	     0.71		  0.71</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
